##### Decision Variables

Let $x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}$ denote the number of units of drug type $i$ to order daily, for each $i$ in the set of drug types $I$.

##### Parameters

Let $I$ be the set of drug types:
- NSAIDs
- Antirheumatic Drugs
